msgstr "每层使用与[快速入门](../quickstart.md)相同的 `objective()` 和 `sample()`。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:49
msgid "The codebase provides a layered class structure:"
msgstr "代码库提供分层类结构："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:51
msgid ""
"**`DBNPretrainer`**: stacks multiple RBM layers and runs greedy "
"unsupervised pretraining layer by layer."
msgstr "**`DBNPretrainer`**：堆叠多个 RBM 层，逐层执行贪婪无监督预训练。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:52
msgid ""
"**`AbstractSupervisedDBN`**: defines the general interface for supervised"
" DBN training (pretraining, fine-tuning, classification, prediction)."
msgstr "**`AbstractSupervisedDBN`**：定义监督 DBN 训练的通用接口（预训练、前向传播、损失）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:53
msgid ""
"**`AbstractSupervisedDBNClassifier`**: extends the abstract interface "
"with common classifiers (logistic regression, SVM, random forest)."
msgstr "**`AbstractSupervisedDBN`**：定义监督 DBN 训练的通用接口（预训练、前向传播、损失）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:54
msgid ""
"**`SupervisedDBNClassification`**: concrete implementation for "
"classification tasks, including fine-tuning network construction."
msgstr "**`SupervisedDBNClassification`**：分类任务的具体实现，含微调和混淆矩阵报告。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:56
msgid "Three Training Modes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:58
msgid "After pretraining, three training modes are available:"
msgstr "预训练后，提供三种训练模式："

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:60
msgid ""
"**Unsupervised mode**: only pretrain, use the DBN as a fixed feature "
"extractor (`DBNPretrainer.transform`)."
msgstr "**无监督模式**：仅预训练，将 DBN 用作固定特征提取器（`DBNPretrainer.transform`）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:61
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Classifier mode**: attach a downstream classifier (logistic regression,"
" SVM, or random forest) on top of the last layer, no backprop through the"
" RBMs."
msgstr "**分类器模式**：在预训练特征之上接下游分类器（逻辑回归、SVM 或随机森林）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:62
msgid ""
"**Fine-tuning mode**: unroll the stack into a deep neural network "
"initialized with pretrained RBM weights, then backpropagate with labels "
"using `CrossEntropyLoss` and SGD with L2 regularization. Dropout can be "
"enabled to prevent overfitting."
msgstr "**微调模式**：将堆叠展开为深度神经网络，用预训练权重初始化，然后端到端带标签微调。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/tutorials/dbn_classification.md:64
msgid ""
"The sampler configuration is inherited per RBM layer from the [Quick "
"Start](../quickstart.md)."
msgstr "采样器配置按 RBM 层从[快速入门](../quickstart.md)继承。"

